ring plant was indeed mimicking Nyx's tactics.",0,""],["w",0.65],["ctl","avg1_110","c","007","vexation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["goon"],["chd",1,2,"avg1_110","a","002",null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","009","shy",null,-0.365,1.5,null,null,"OutCubic",0.45],["w",0.45],["say","avg2_985","Your Majesty. Does the Gen-3 Intelligent Plant meet your standards? Does my loyalty meet your approval?",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"w","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Darcia is flaunting this power for one reason: to compel me to accept her allegiance.",2,""],["w",0.7],["mrt",0,"w","021","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","Whatever her motives, accepting her loyalty is a one-way ticket to disaster.",2,""],["mrt",3,"w",null,null,null],["w",0.15],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.45],["hide","avg2_985",0.45],["w",0.3],["bg","story_main_be_04_002_FP",0,0.7],["w",0.4],["se","se_055"],["w",1.8],["mrt",1,"w","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Her \"loyalty\" is just a desperate obsession with validation. In the end, it'll get everyone killed.",2,""],["mrt",3,"w",null,null,null],["w",0.51],["bgm",""],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.7],["w",0.7],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","uniseed_basement_corelab",0,0.0],["cbg",0,null,null,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["show","avg2_985","a","002",null,-0.145,1.2,0,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.7],["w",0.45],["mrt",2,"w","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","So, how do I answer?",2,""],["mrt",3,"w",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["choice",["It's utterly useless","It's nothing special","I'm pleased"],[[["bgm","m14"],["mrt",2,"x","002","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","Your plants look formidable, but in practice? They are utterly useless.",1,""],["mrt",3,"x",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","007","vexation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg2_985","U-useless...? Your Majesty, I don't understand... In what way have I failed you?",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"w","009","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","Individually, yes, they rival Firenze in raw power.==W== But during that fight, they showed absolutely no teamwork.",1,""],["w",0.85],["mrt",0,"x","002","attention","daintou"],["goon"],["mrt",0,"w","020",null,null],["say","avg3_100","When the melee unit engaged Firenze, the seed-shooter should have provided cover fire. With proper support, they could have won without a scratch.",1,""],["mrt",0,"x","012","exclamation","jushou"],["say","avg3_100","Instead, your so-called \"intelligent\" plant completely ignored its ally's safety, choosing instead to secure a better vantage point for itself.",1,""],["mrt",3,"x",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","009","sweaty",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg2_985","But sacrifice is a valid tactic, Your Majesty.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"x","012","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","Sacrifice is sometimes necessary. But that wasn't a tactic.",1,""],["mrt",0,"w","020","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","A single unit might defeat an average Trekker. But a hundred? They wouldn't fight the enemy—",1,""],["w",0.45],["mrt",0,"w","009","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","They'd likely trip over each other in the confusion.",1,""],["se","se_067"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"Xiao"],["tsk","Xiao"],["mrt",0,"x","026",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Do you honestly expect me to be satisfied with such flawed goods?",1,""],["mrt",3,"x",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","007","flurry",null,null,null,null,"daintou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg2_985","I... Your Majesty's vision far exceeds my own. I see that now. I will begin improvements immediately.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"x","005","shock",null],["say","avg3_100","Be more selective with your \"nutrients.\" Haste makes waste.",1,""],["mrt",3,"x",null,null,null],["w",0.51],["se","se_062"],["stg",0,null,-50.0,1.2,"OutCubic",0.6,null,null,null],["w",0.6],["mrt",2,"x","026","exclamation",null],["say","avg3_100","And do not overuse my Bishop. Is that clear?",1,""],["mrt",3,"x",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","009","shy",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg2_985","Y-yes... As you command...",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"w","010","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Phew. That should buy us some time.",2,""],["mrt",3,"w",null,null,null],["w",0.5]],[["bgm","m14"],["mrt",1,"w","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","If I praise their strength, she'll immediately press for my acceptance.",2,""],["mrt",0,"w","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","If I call them weak, she'll just harvest more people as \"nutrients\" to improve them.",2,""],["mrt",0,"w","016","vexation","lengzhan"],["say","avg3_100","I have to thread the needle here...",2,""],["mrt",3,"w",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_344"],["stg",0,null,-80.0,null,"OutQuad",0.8,null,null,null],["w",0.8],["stg",0,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.85],["mrt",2,"w","002","exclamation",null],["say","avg3_100","Honestly, these Intelligent Plants are nothing special.",1,""],["mrt",0,"x","012","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Tell me, Darcia. Have you ever seen the Garden of Parasite?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","009","awkward",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg2_985","My apologies... Your Majesty. I was away at HQ when the Trekkers destroyed it. I never saw it in person.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"x","012","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","The Garden of Parasite was a massive, monstrous tree. It released a kind of mist that confused friend and foe, while allowing it to control every other monster in the forest.",1,""],["mrt",0,"x","003",null,null],["say","avg3_100","In hindsight, it likely gained those abilities through the influence of my Bishop piece.",1,""],["mrt",0,"x","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Since your plants share that same origin, they should share that power.==W== And yet?",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"w","005","question",null],["goon"],["w",0.7],["se","se_070"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["tsk","Xiao"],["mrt",0,"x","026",null,null],["say","avg3_100","They ganged up two-on-one against Firenze and barely won. That satisfies you? I expected better. Go back and study the true authority of the Bishop piece.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","007","flurry",null,null,null,null,"daintou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg2_985","Your Majesty... I was presumptuous in my expectation. I will resume my research immediately and won't return until the plants meet your standards.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"w","010","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Phew... That should keep her off my back for a while.",2,""],["mrt",3,"w",null,null,null],["w",0.51]],[["bgm","m14"],["mrt",2,"w","019",null,null],["say","avg3_100","They are exceptional specimens, Darcia.==W== You have pleased me.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"w","004","happy","daintou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"w",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","003","sigh",null,-0.2,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg2_985","Your satisfaction is my highest honor.==W== Your Majesty, will you now accept my—",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","009","shy",null,-0.14,null,null,"lengzhan","OutQuad",0.4],["w",0.4],["goon"],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"x","002","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Accept your allegiance? Perhaps.==W== But first... Fill every empty tank in your lab with \"nutrients.\" Begin cultivating the next generation immediately.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"w","012","speechless",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"w",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg2_985","Yes... Yes, of course...==W== I see it now, Your Majesty.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","008","idea",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["goon"],["ctl","avg2_985","a","009","shy",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg2_985","If that is the price of your acceptance... I pay it gladly.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"w","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","And do not insult me with inferior \"nutrients.\"==W== I expect every specimen to be of the caliber of Nyx's.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"x","002","exclamation","jushou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"x",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg2_985","a","003",null,null,-0.2,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.4],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg2_985","a","002",null,null,-0.14,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg2_985","As you command, Your Majesty.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"w","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","The Trekker Camp is practically deserted, and subjects like Nyx are hard to come by.==W== That should stall her for a while.",2,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"w","010","sigh",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"w",null,null,null],["w",0.5]]]],["w",0.1],["bgm",""],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.8],["w",0.8],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","uniseed_basement_corelab",0,0.0],["cbg",0,90.0,0.0,1.07,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["show","avg1_110","c","002",0.81,-0.1,1.15,0,null,0.0],["show","avg2_985","a","002",0.43,-0.17,1.25,0,null,0.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.75],["w",0.15],["cbg",0,-20.0,null,null,"OutCubic",0.75,null,null,null],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,0.35,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,"attention",0.65,null,null,1.0,"daintou","OutQuad",0.55],["w",0.55],["bgm","m46"],["say","avg1_110","Lady Darcia, ==SEX12== Tyrant hasn't rested since last night. Now that the demonstration is concluded...",0,""],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,-150.0,null,null,"OutCubic",0.6,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,0.75,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.6],["hide","avg1_110",0.6],["ctl","avg2_985","a","007","idea",0.51,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.6],