t.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"s","012","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Oh? Do you know what the real Tyrant is actually like?",2,""],["mrt",3,"s",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_103","a","002",0.63,-0.2,1.3,0,"speechless",0.0],["say","avg4_999","As your former Priest and current secretary, yes, I know your true self. However, with insufficient permissions. I cannot disclose that information.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_103","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["say","avg4_999","Besides... I was the one who called you Tyrant first, just so you know.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"s","021","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","Alright, alright. I know you were first.",2,""],["mrt",3,"s",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_401"],["say","avg4_999","I suggest you secure a soul pact immediately. Completing this task will raise your clearance level and unlock new powers.",0,""],["say","avg4_999","To break this stalemate, please reconsider my proposal.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"s","012","question",null],["say","avg3_100","And what powers do I get, exactly? Ugh, never mind. Let me guess: \"Insufficient Permissions,\" right?",2,""],["mrt",3,"s",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["say","avg4_999","Precisely. But I assure you: whatever functions you unlock will be vital to your ascension as the true Tyrant. That is the core purpose of the Well of Worlds Tyrant Development System.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"s","021","think",null],["say","avg3_100","You, Darcia... Everyone's obsessed with crowning me \"Tyrant.\" Is it even really that good a gig?",2,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"s","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Whatever. I'm in a tight spot, sure, but I'm not out of moves yet. Vita, Firenze isn't actually loyal to Darcia, is she?",2,""],["mrt",3,"s",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["show","avg1_110","c","016",0.2,-0.14,1.3,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,null,null,null,0.7,null,"OutSine",0.7],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,null,-0.21,null,null,null,"OutSine",6.0],["w",0.5],["se","se_401"],["w",0.45],["say","avg4_999","My analysis concurs. Upon seeing Miss Nyx in custody, Firenze exhibited a spike in heart rate and rapid respiration—classic distress signals.",0,""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",1.2],["hide","avg1_110",1.2],["show","avg3_1265","c","010",0.8,-0.3,1.3,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_1265","c",null,null,null,null,null,0.7,null,"OutSine",0.7],["ctl","avg3_1265","c",null,null,null,-0.21,null,null,null,"OutSine",5.0],["w",0.6],["say","avg4_999","Her vitals only stabilized once Darcia confirmed Nyx's immediate safety.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_1265","c",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",1.2],["hide","avg3_1265",1.2],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"s","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","She claims she wants revenge on Nyx, but her physiological response shows \"concern.\"",2,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"s","012",null,null],["say","avg3_100","That said, Darcia hasn't breathed a word about the HQ army arriving. Is she suppressing the intel, or does she just not care?",2,""],["mrt",3,"s",null,null,null],["w",0.51],["se","se_076"],["trn",0,0,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_speaking",1,2],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,0],["bg","hotel_guest_room",0,0.0],["stg",0,-20.0,null,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,null,null,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["show","avg1_110","c","012",null,-0.09,1.15,0,null,null],["w",0.3],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",0.95],["mrt",1,"x","014","attention","diantou"],["say","avg3_100","By the way, what were you staring at? You seemed completely entranced...==W== That's not like you.",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",3,"x",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","010",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_110","The sky.",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,80.0,null,1.05,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["film",0],["w",0.65],["say","0","I follow Firenze's gaze east. There's nothing unusual as 